999
00:55:06,794 --> 00:55:08,056
Okay?

1000
00:55:09,536 --> 00:55:12,016
Don't cry. It's okay.

1001
00:55:12,017 --> 00:55:13,234
It's gonna be okay.

1002
00:55:28,163 --> 00:55:30,382
Take off my dress.

1003
