Nina's coming home early.

1004
00:57:05,957 --> 00:57:07,524
So we have to beat her home.

1005
00:57:09,526 --> 00:57:10,657
We should get going.

1006
00:57:11,397 --> 00:57:12,746
- Okay.
- Okay?

1007
00:57:14,835 --> 00:57:16,662
This is gonna sound
really cheesy,

1008
00:57:16,663 --> 00:57:19,927
