1032
00:59:48,989 --> 00:59:50,598
No, I know. I was just
feeling extra manly today.

1033
00:59:50,599 --> 00:59:52,775
- Okay.
- Yeah.

1034
00:59:52,776 --> 00:59:54,298
How was the trip? How's Cece?

1035
00:59:54,299 --> 00:59:55,779
She's good.

1036
00:59:57,215 --> 00:59:59,172
Listen.

1037
00:59:59,173 --> 01:00:00,740
I'm very sorry
