1038
01:00:02,046 --> 01:00:03,655
It was a very long drive.

1039
01:00:03,656 --> 01:00:05,222
I was very tired.

1040
01:00:05,223 --> 01:00:07,267
I do not sleep well in hotels,

1041
01:00:07,268 --> 01:00:08,660
